    },
    {
      "id": "38cc5a51-854f-5527-85fa-1c8c4fd867e7",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 3,
      "x": 340,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "요즘 훈련이 조금 버거워요.\n감독님은 어떻게 생각하세요?",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Training's been kind of rough lately.\nWhat do you think, Coach?",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d785f589-52a3-5b7f-9e74-a8e77acd0ffe",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "면담 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "38cc5a51-854f-5527-85fa-1c8c4fd867e7"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "34540723-4b52-578d-86d9-4d5e94e0a522": "interview",
        "35a06853-4a82-52f0-b9ef-0cf69309d879": -1,
        "4f709b68-6991-54f0-9772-d208f3c47f72": 0,
        "30fbab9b-1237-5328-bba9-51b8e32606c3": "",
        "866da457-065e-577d-8b8f-85e197538c3b": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cdf95302-9c1b-5ef8-a374-d5086f8c7b54",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "6b469569-fe92-5cc1-b13e-f18243785ff6",
          "text": "잘하고 있어. 조금만 더 버티자.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "2204b27e-af31-541c-ad7a-391e5826bfa2": "ok>trust:+5;ng>trust:+1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "81139970-3ac2-5b6d-b7cd-95ab55e8a661",
          "text": "힘들면 강도를 조절해 줄게.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "2204b27e-af31-541c-ad7a-391e5826bfa2": "trust:+4"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "f80a8cea-1251-55b5-badc-81063352209a",
          "text": "프로라면 견뎌야지.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "2204b27e-af31-541c-ad7a-391e5826bfa2": "ok>trust:+2;ng>trust:-3"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:6b469569-fe92-5cc1-b13e-f18243785ff6": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "You're doing great. Just hang in a bit longer.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:81139970-3ac2-5b6d-b7cd-95ab55e8a661": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "If it's too much, I'll ease up the intensity.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:f80a8cea-1251-55b5-badc-81063352209a": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "A pro should be able to take it.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d660e2a5-cab8-5b7c-8e1f-922aaa09a9eb",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 940,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "네… 감독님 말 믿고 버텨 볼게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Okay… I'll trust you and push through.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "8c7db8ea-898d-5ebb-9a33-34da11594421": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4c8077f9-79c8-5c31-a18e-4125921f4cd1",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "말은 쉽죠.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Easy for you to say.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "8c7db8ea-898d-5ebb-9a33-34da11594421": "ng"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2bdfe81f-5c66-589a-af92-1b50ede84648",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "정말요? 그럼 조금 숨 돌릴 수 있겠네요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Really? Then I can finally catch my breath.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d83c2783-b044-5b21-a9f8-c4b1f6cbdf94",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 300,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "…맞는 말이에요. 더 해 볼게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "…You're right. I'll keep at it.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "8c7db8ea-898d-5ebb-9a33-34da11594421": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2a347d8f-1604-51f6-85b9-3a622ee373ec",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 10,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 300,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "알겠습니다. (표정이 굳는다)",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Understood. (Their face hardens.)",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "8c7db8ea-898d-5ebb-9a33-34da11594421": "ng"
      }
    }
  ],
